WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,230
What exactly are you going to do?

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:05,030
The large number of people can at least intimidate Chen Zhenghao

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:08,630
We work together to seal the corridor door to resist the invasion.

4
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:11,430
The biggest problem right now is the lack of reliable strongholds

5
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:18,030
Perfect as a fortress of refuge

6
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:22,540
I hope you will join our team and fight against Chen Zhenghao together

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,940
It must have been Fang Yuqing who revealed my family's situation

8
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:28,570
These people just want to take over my safety.

9
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:29,970
Good intentions accepted

10
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:31,770
I am very comfortable living alone

11
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:33,530
You will lead the stronghold on your own

12
00:00:33,530 --> 00:00:36,330
Zhang Yi, everyone’s lives are on the line now

13
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:37,730
You can't be short-sighted

14
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,130
Only the collective can survive

15
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,530
Choosing your home is just because of the convenience of having water from the balcony.

16
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:45,730
We can also protect you after you move in

17
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,130
Not just taking advantage
